    "html": "<section class=\"hero\">\n      <div class=\"shell\">\n        <article class=\"hero-card\">\n          <div class=\"hero-grid\">\n            <div>\n              <span class=\"eyebrow\">Eastern Suburbs Service Page</span>\n              <h1>Flooring Installation Eastern Suburbs</h1>\n              <p>Estimate laminate, hybrid or engineered timber flooring for Eastern Suburbs projects.</p>\n              <div class=\"hero-actions\" style=\"margin-top: 24px;\">\n                <a class=\"button\" href=\"quote.html\">Get Eastern Suburbs quote</a>\n                <a class=\"button-secondary\" href=\"floorplan.html\">Measure from floor plan</a>\n              </div>\n            </div>\n            <div class=\"stat-stack\">\n              <div class=\"stat-card\">\n                <strong>Common project mix</strong>\n                Apartments, terraces, premium homes and renovation work.\n              </div>\n              <div class=\"stat-card\">\n                <strong>Important quote inputs</strong>\n                Product type, area, property details, removal, prep and trims.\n              </div>\n              <div class=\"stat-card\">\n                <strong>Why use this tool</strong>\n                Captures key site conditions early.\n              </div>\n            </div>\n          </div>\n        </article>\n      </div>\n    </section>\n\n    <section class=\"section\">\n      <div class=\"shell grid-2\">\n        <article class=\"section-card\">\n          <span class=\"eyebrow\">Local Quote Guide</span>\n          <h2 style=\"margin-top: 18px;\">Eastern Suburbs flooring quotes with clear site details</h2>\n          <p>Review quote clarity before deciding.</p>\n        </article>\n        <article class=\"section-card\">\n          <span class=\"eyebrow\">Products</span>\n          <h2 style=\"margin-top: 18px;\">Laminate, hybrid and engineered timber</h2>\n          <p>Compare laminate, hybrid and engineered timber before final review.</p>\n        </article>\n      </div>\n    </section>\n\n    <section class=\"section\">\n      <div class=\"shell grid-3\">\n        <article class=\"mini-card\">\n          <h3>Laminate flooring</h3>\n          <p>Often used where the job needs a cleaner budget position while still aiming for a timber-look finish.</p>\n        </article>\n        <article class=\"mini-card\">\n          <h3>Hybrid flooring</h3>\n          <p>A frequent fit for practical apartment and home updates where everyday use and durability matter.</p>\n        </article>\n        <article class=\"mini-card\">\n          <h3>Engineered timber</h3>\n          <p>Often selected for more premium Eastern Suburbs projects where finish quality is a key part of the brief.</p>\n        </article>\n      </div>\n    </section>\n\n    <section class=\"section\">\n      <div class=\"shell grid-2\">\n        <article class=\"section-card\">\n          <span class=\"eyebrow\">Project Conditions</span>\n          <h2 style=\"margin-top: 18px;\">What can change the final quote?</h2>\n          <p>Preparation, removal, stairs, apartment details and trims are captured early.</p>\n        </article>\n        <article class=\"section-card\">\n          <span class=\"eyebrow\">Floor Plan Option</span>\n          <h2 style=\"margin-top: 18px;\">Use a floor plan if the property layout is easier to trace</h2>\n          <p>For apartments or renovations, upload a plan and trace the flooring rooms.</p>\n        </article>\n      </div>\n    </section>\n\n    <section class=\"section\">\n      <div class=\"shell\">\n        <article class=\"section-card\">\n          <span class=\"eyebrow\">Quote Ready</span>\n          <h2 style=\"margin-top: 18px;\">Start with a clearer Eastern Suburbs flooring estimate</h2>\n          <p>Start a structured quote, or measure from a floor plan first.</p>\n          <div class=\"hero-actions\" style=\"margin-top: 24px;\">\n            <a class=\"button\" href=\"quote.html\">Get Eastern Suburbs quote</a>\n            <a class=\"button-secondary\" href=\"floorplan.html\">Measure from floor plan</a>\n          </div>\n        </article>\n      </div>\n    </section>\n\n    <section class=\"section\">\n      <div class=\"shell\">\n        <article class=\"section-card\">\n          <span class=\"eyebrow\">FAQ</span>\n          <h2 style=\"margin-top: 18px;\">Eastern Suburbs flooring quote questions</h2>\n          <div class=\"faq-accordion\">\n            <details class=\"faq-toggle\">\n              <summary>Can I get a flooring quote for the Eastern Suburbs online?</summary>\n              <div class=\"faq-toggle-body\">\n                <p>Yes. Operon Flooring supports online flooring quotes for Eastern Suburbs projects.</p>\n              </div>\n            </details>\n            <details class=\"faq-toggle\">\n              <summary>Do apartment details need to be checked for Eastern Suburbs flooring quotes?</summary>\n              <div class=\"faq-toggle-body\">\n                <p>Yes. Final price is confirmed after site details are reviewed.</p>\n              </div>\n            </details>\n            <details class=\"faq-toggle\">\n              <summary>What flooring products can be quoted?</summary>\n              <div class=\"faq-toggle-body\">\n                <p>Laminate, hybrid and engineered timber flooring are the main product categories supported.</p>\n              </div>\n            </details>\n            <details class=\"faq-toggle\">\n              <summary>Can I measure the project from a floor plan first?</summary>\n              <div class=\"faq-toggle-body\">\n                <p>Yes. Use the floor plan measurement assistant to confirm the flooring area before you submit.</p>\n              </div>\n            </details>\n            <details class=\"faq-toggle\">\n              <summary>Is the Eastern Suburbs online quote final?</summary>\n              <div class=\"faq-toggle-body\">\n                <p>No. It is an estimate based on the information provided and is confirmed after project review.</p>\n              </div>\n            </details>\n          </div>\n        </article>\n      </div>\n    </section>\n\n    <section class=\"section\">\n      <div class=\"shell\">\n        <article class=\"section-card\">\n          <span class=\"eyebrow\">Related Pages</span>\n          <h2 style=\"margin-top: 18px;\">Continue comparing Sydney options</h2>\n          <div class=\"link-grid\" style=\"margin-top: 22px;\">\n            <a class=\"link-card\" href=\"flooring-installation-cost-sydney.html\"><strong>Flooring Installation Cost Sydney</strong><span>Review the main scope items that matter most in Eastern Suburbs jobs.</span></a>\n            <a class=\"link-card\" href=\"engineered-timber-flooring-sydney.html\"><strong>Engineered Timber Flooring Sydney</strong><span>Review the premium flooring path common in higher-spec projects.</span></a>\n            <a class=\"link-card\" href=\"flooring-miranda.html\"><strong>Flooring Miranda</strong><span>See another Sydney location page with different site conditions.</span></a>\n          </div>\n        </article>\n      </div>\n    </section>"
